date, symbol, futureOi, futureOiChange, futureOiChangePct,
callOi, putOi, pcr, createdAt
```

#### [NEW] DailyPrice.js
```
date, symbol, open, high, low, close, volume,
deliveryQty, deliveryPct, sma20, sma50, sma200, atr14, createdAt
```

