### Backend — New Collectors

#### [NEW] bhavCopy.js (`src/collectors/bhavCopy.js`)
Fetches NSE daily bhav copy CSV after market close (3:45 PM).
Parses OHLCV + delivery data → saves to `DailyPrice` collection.

#### [NEW] oiCollector.js (`src/collectors/oiCollector.js`)
Fetches futures OI data from NSE `/api/live-analysis-variations`.
Parses OI + OI change % → saves to `OiData` collection.

#### [NEW] sectorCollector.js (`src/collectors/sectorCollector.js`)
Fetches Nifty sectoral index values from NSE `/api/allIndices`.
Saves to `SectorIndex` collection.

#### [MODIFY] [cron.js](file:///c:/Stock-Trading/backend/src/scheduler/cron.js)
Extend pipeline to: BhavCopy → OI → Sector Index → FII/DII → BulkDeals → Analysis (in sequence, after 4:30 PM IST).

#### [MODIFY] [seed.js](file:///c:/Stock-Trading/backend/src/seed.js)
Expand to all Nifty 50 stocks with correct `sectorIndex` mappings.

