## Phase 2: Analysis Engine

### [MODIFY] [accumulationAnalyzer.js](file:///c:/Stock-Trading/backend/src/services/accumulationAnalyzer.js)
Expand from 2 to **5 components**:

| Component | Weight | Source |
|---|---|---|
| Institutional Flow (FII net) | 30% | `FiiDiiData` |
| Bulk Deal Sentiment | 25% | [BulkDeal](file:///c:/Stock-Trading/backend/src/services/accumulationAnalyzer.js#58-91) |
| OI Signal (Long/Short buildup) | 20% | `OiData` |
| Delivery % Score | 15% | `DailyPrice` |
| Hidden Accumulation (volume↑, price flat) | 10% | `DailyPrice` |

Score: 0–100 (was -100 to +100, normalized to 0–100 for UI clarity).

#### [NEW] relativeStrengthAnalyzer.js (`src/services/relativeStrengthAnalyzer.js`)
- Calculates RS = (Stock normalized return / Nifty50 normalized return) × 100
- Calculates RS vs sector index
- RS trend: STRENGTHENING / WEAKENING
- RS percentile: where current RS sits in 60-day historical range

#### [NEW] sectorRotationAnalyzer.js (`src/services/sectorRotationAnalyzer.js`)
- Ranks all Nifty sectors by: avg RS + 10-day RS momentum + FII flow
- Detects ROTATING_IN / ROTATING_OUT signals

#### [NEW] technicalAnalyzer.js (`src/services/technicalAnalyzer.js`)
Modular framework — calculates and returns individual scores for:
- RSI (14-day): sweet spot 40–65 = bullish
- MACD: crossover + histogram direction
- Volume Price Analysis (OBV trend vs price trend)
- Supertrend (10-period, 3× ATR)
- MA Alignment (price > SMA20 > SMA50 > SMA200)

Each indicator returns -100 to +100. Weighted composite returned.

#### [NEW] stockSelector.js (`src/core/stockSelector.js`)
**Main scoring engine.** For each stock:

```
Composite Score =
  smartMoneyScore × 0.30
  + rsScore × 0.25
  + technicalScore × 0.25
  + fundamentalScore × 0.10
  + riskScore × 0.10
```

Also calculates:
- **Entry range**: current price ±1–2%
- **Target**: current price + 2.5 × ATR14
- **Stop Loss**: current price − 1 × ATR14
- **R:R ratio**: target distance / SL distance
- **Position size**: 2% portfolio risk / SL% (Kelly simplified)

#### [NEW] divergenceDetector.js (`src/services/divergenceDetector.js`)
- Compares 30-day accumulation score vs 30-day price change
- Detects: BULLISH_DIVERGENCE, BEARISH_DIVERGENCE, ACCELERATING_ACCUMULATION
- Saves alerts to `DivergenceAlert` collection

---

## Phase 3: Smart Money Intelligence

#### [NEW] institutionClassifier.js (`src/services/institutionClassifier.js`)
Classifies bulk deal buyers by tier:
- Tier 1: Proprietary desks, known hedge funds
- Tier 2: Strategic FIIs, domestic MFs
- Tier 3: Passive ETFs / index rebalancers
- Tier 4: Retail MFs, unknown HNIs

Calculates institution win-rate from historical deals (updated weekly).

#### [NEW] signalFreshness.js (`src/services/signalFreshness.js`)
Time-decay weights for signals:

| Signal Type | Full Validity | Decay |
|---|---|---|
| Tier-1 bulk buy | 96 hours | Linear |
| FII flow | 48 hours | Linear |
| OI buildup | 240 hours | Slow |
| Technical breakout | 12 hours | Fast |

Applied when combining scores in `stockSelector.js`.

