## Phase 4: API Layer

### New Endpoints

#### [MODIFY] [scan.js](file:///c:/Stock-Trading/backend/src/routes/scan.js)
- `GET /api/v1/scan/latest` — returns top 20 scored stocks with full data
- `GET /api/v1/scan/divergences` — returns active divergence alerts

#### [NEW] footprint.js (`src/routes/footprint.js`)
- `GET /api/v1/footprint/:symbol?days=90` — returns chart data:
  - OHLCV (DailyPrice)
  - FII/DII daily net (FiiDiiData)
  - OI change % (OiData)
  - Bulk deal buy/sell markers (BulkDeal)
  - Delivery % (DailyPrice)

#### [NEW] sectors.js (`src/routes/sectors.js`)
- `GET /api/v1/sectors/rotation` — returns sector rankings + signals

#### [MODIFY] [portfolio.js](file:///c:/Stock-Trading/backend/src/routes/portfolio.js)
- `GET /api/v1/portfolio/:id/daily-update` — for each open position returns:
  - Current price, PnL
  - Today's FII flow, bulk deals, OI change
  - HOLD / BOOK PARTIAL / EXIT recommendation

#### [MODIFY] [app.js](file:///c:/Stock-Trading/backend/src/app.js)
Register new routes.

