## Phase 6: Automation & Alerts

#### [MODIFY] [cron.js](file:///c:/Stock-Trading/backend/src/scheduler/cron.js)
Full daily pipeline (Mon–Fri at 4:30 PM IST / 11:00 UTC):
```
Step 1: Fetch Bhav Copy (OHLCV + delivery) → save DailyPrice
Step 2: Fetch OI data → save OiData
Step 3: Fetch Sector indices → save SectorIndex
Step 4: Fetch FII/DII (stock-level) → save FiiDiiData
Step 5: Fetch Bulk Deals → save BulkDeal
Step 6: Run StockSelector (all 50 stocks) → save SmartMoneyScore
Step 7: Run DivergenceDetector → save DivergenceAlert
Step 8: Update open portfolio positions with daily tracking data
```

#### [NEW] alertService.js (`src/services/alertService.js`)
Checks after each pipeline run:
- SL breach (position down > stop %)
- Target hit (position up > target)
- High-severity divergence detected
- Sends webhook / email notification

