## Verification Plan

### Automated — Run after each phase

```powershell
# Phase 1: Verify data collection
node --env-file=src/.env src/seed.js

# Trigger manual pipeline
node --env-file=src/.env -e "require('./src/scheduler/cron.js').runPipeline()"

# Verify data in DB
node --env-file=src/.env -e "
  const {connectMongo}=require('./src/config/db');
  const DailyPrice=require('./src/models/DailyPrice');
  (async()=>{await connectMongo(); console.log(await DailyPrice.countDocuments()); process.exit(0);})()
"
```

```powershell
# Phase 2-3: Verify analysis engine
node --env-file=src/.env -e "
  const {connectMongo}=require('./src/config/db');
  const selector=require('./src/core/stockSelector');
  (async()=>{await connectMongo(); const r=await selector.scanUniverse(); console.log(JSON.stringify(r[0], null, 2)); process.exit(0);})()
"
```

```powershell
# Phase 4: Test API endpoints
Invoke-RestMethod -Uri 'http://localhost:4000/api/v1/scan/latest'
Invoke-RestMethod -Uri 'http://localhost:4000/api/v1/footprint/RELIANCE?days=30'
Invoke-RestMethod -Uri 'http://localhost:4000/api/v1/sectors/rotation'
```

### Manual — Frontend verification
1. Open `http://localhost:3000` — verify dashboard shows scored stocks with entry/target/SL
2. Click any stock → verify 5-panel footprint chart renders
3. Add a position in portfolio → verify daily update shows HOLD/EXIT recommendation
4. Check sector rotation page for ranking table

---

> [!NOTE]
> **Phasing strategy:** Each phase is independent and testable before the next. Start with Phase 1 (data collection). Without real data, all scores default to neutral (50) which is expected behavior — not a bug.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **NSE data timing:** NSE bulk deals and bhav copy are only available after 3:30 PM IST. Run the pipeline manually during dev using [runPipeline()](file:///c:/Stock-Trading/backend/src/scheduler/cron.js#20-37) directly or wait until EOD.
